Domain name: NMG.com
OUs created: Finance, HR, IT, Operations
Security groups created: Finance-Users, HR-Users, IT-Users, Operations-Users

Purpose of each OU: 
1. Finance - This department represents the management of company funds, budgeting, and overall financial health.
2. HR - This department represents the management of hiring, payroll, benefits, and employee relations.
3. IT -  This department represents the management of technical infrastructure, network security, and hardware or software support.
4. Operations -  This department represents the execution and optimization of day-to-day production and service delivery.

